6. Build Phases & Timeline
Total: 14 weeks (3.5 months) to production launch
Phase 1 — Foundation (Weeks 1–3) Student login, JWT, LMS frontend repo setup, dashboard shell showing live attendance and exam results from existing SHO data, basic course view with modules and lessons list. Deliverable: Student can log in and see their batch info, attendance, and exam results.
Phase 2 — Content Delivery (Weeks 4–6) Video player with resume, PDF/text/link lesson types, module unlock logic, Course Builder in SHO App, completion tracking. Deliverable: Students can watch videos, read PDFs, mark lessons complete.
Phase 3 — Assessments (Weeks 7–9) Quiz engine with question builder, auto-grading, assignment file upload, mentor grading interface, grades visible in LMS. Deliverable: Students can take quizzes and submit assignments; mentors can grade.
Phase 4 — Communication & Certificates (Weeks 10–12) Announcement system, discussion forums per lesson, push and email notifications, certificate auto-generation on completion, public verification page. Deliverable: Full LMS feature-complete. Internal launch ready.
Phase 5 — Polish & Analytics (Weeks 13–14) LMS analytics dashboard in SHO App, student progress PDF reports, performance optimisations, mobile responsiveness audit, user acceptance testing, production launch. Deliverable: Production-ready launch.





